], ["was", 69.158, 69.302], ["wearing", 69.302, 69.523], ["pajamas", 69.523, 70.04], ["underneath", 70.04, 70.523], ["the", 70.756, 70.833], ["prince", 70.833, 71.172], ["was", 71.172, 71.316], ["the", 71.316, 71.392], ["last", 71.392, 71.731], ["one", 71.731, 71.96], ["holding", 71.96, 72.273], ["a", 72.273, 72.307], ["sword", 72.307, 72.748], ["i", 72.964, 73.049], ["looked", 73.049, 73.32], ["at", 73.32, 73.439], ["it", 73.439, 73.591], ["it", 73.776, 73.928], ["bent", 73.928, 74.191], ["too", 74.191, 74.606], ["the", 74.866, 74.951], ["king", 74.951, 75.239], ["spent", 75.239, 75.553], ["ten", 75.553, 75.866], ["years", 75.866, 76.248], ["keeping", 76.248, 76.544], ["me", 76.544, 76.663], ["away", 76.663, 76.943], ["from", 76.943, 77.121], ["that", 77.121, 77.282], ["stone", 77.282, 77.714], ["it", 77.93, 78.023], ["took", 78.023, 78.176], ["me", 78.176, 78.294], ["one", 78.294, 78.65], ["second", 78.65, 79.074], ["to", 79.074, 79.159], ["break", 79.159, 79.455], ["it", 79.455, 79.616], ["what's", 79.84, 80.035], ["the", 80.035, 80.12], ["first", 80.12, 80.45], ["thing", 80.45, 80.645], ["you'd", 80.645, 80.882], ["do", 80.882, 81.077], ["with", 81.077, 81.221], ["infinite", 81.221, 81.696], ["power", 81.696, 82.323]], "lines": [[0.0, 4.314, "In this town, every kid touches the Power Stone at ten, and it shows your power level."], [4.584, 8.066, "I'm the kid who sweeps the throne room. This year, I broke the stone."], [8.35, 12.826, "Most kids get a ten. The King is ten thousand. Nobody has ever beaten him."], [13.099, 16.388, "The Prince went first. Five thousand. The whole court cheered."], [16.647, 20.384, "Then he pointed his crown at me. \"Let the sweeper try. Maybe it'll say one.\""], [20.663, 22.799, "The whole room laughed. Even the King."], [23.049, 24.007, "I touched the stone."], [24.246, 25.042, "It said zero."], [25.276, 27.937, "The Prince laughed so hard he fell down the throne steps."], [28.183, 31.292, "Then the zero turned into a one. Ten. A hundred."], [31.473, 34.225, "A thousand. Five thousand. Past the Prince."], [34.437, 36.158, "Ten thousand. Past the King."], [36.389, 39.062, "The numbers blurred into light. The stone cracked."], [39.273, 41.759, "Then it showed one shape. A sideways eight."], [41.97, 46.043, "And the Power Stone exploded. Every piece floated up, and turned to face me."], [46.202, 48.47, "The whole court gasped. Except the King."], [48.709, 54.123, "\"It only says zero when the number is too big to count,\" he said. \"The last time was the first king of this town.\""], [54.347, 58.897, "He'd known since I was born. That's why he made me the sweeper. So I'd never touch that stone."], [59.105, 60.249, "\"Guards! Take him!\""], [60.507, 62.16, "A hundred guards drew their swords."], [62.382, 64.805, "I lifted one hand, like I was swatting a fly."], [65.023, 70.523, "Every sword in the room bent in half. One guard's armor fell right off. He was wearing pajamas underneath."], [70.756, 74.606, "The Prince was the last one holding a sword. I looked at it. It bent too."], [74.866, 77.714, "The King spent ten years keeping me away from that stone."], [77.93, 79.616, "It took me one second to break it."], [79.84, 82.323, "What's the first thing you'd do with infinite power?"]]}